# The Chair by the Window
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
You moved the chair again.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
The morning light reaches this corner.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
So does the draft. I can choose where I sit, you know.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
Then where would you like it?
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Beside yours. Just for breakfast.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
It is a small answer, but you finally hear the question beneath it.
